% backend: none
% expect-output: -1
% expect-error: ioerror
% oracle: skip the reference reads the job from a positionable file, so the job source can be positioned there
% Scenario: positioning an ordinary file. The job's source is not
% positionable: bytesavailable answers -1, resetfile does nothing, and
% setfileposition raises ioerror.
% Expect: -1, then ioerror.
currentfile bytesavailable =
currentfile resetfile
currentfile 0 setfileposition
